<title>USA: Laboratory Corp Q3 shr loss after charge.</title>
<headline>Laboratory Corp Q3 shr loss after charge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr  loss		  $1.19   profit	 $0.12</p>
<p> Net  loss		146,400   profit	14,400</p>
<p> Sales		    402,600		  417,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 122,922		  122,909</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr    loss		$1.26     loss	 $0.12</p>
<p> Net    loss	    154,700     loss	12,700</p>
<p> Sales		  1,216,500		1,028,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 122,917		  106,424</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Charges in 1996 include $185 million for settlements and related expenses in the quarter ended September 30, $23 million for restructuring and other non-recurring items and $10 million to increase the provision for doubtful accounts in the second quarter.  </p>
<p>Charges in 1995 include $65 million for restructuring related to the merger with Roche Biomedical Laboratories Inc on April 28, 1995, and a $10 million provision for settlements related to various matters, including billing matters.</p>
</text>
